norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:6507b3ff-825f-4ed6-8f69-c1c784084702\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Lying on the floor of the <a href=\"/wiki/Submersible\" title=\"Submersible\">submersible</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>Reminder to Self - The steam <a href=\"/wiki/Mephit\" title=\"Mephit\">mephits</a> in the starboard pressure tank have bred again and now there are too many of the blasted things cooking away in there. need to blow the valve to release three of four of the vapey bastards, but I can't loosen the exhaust bolt without a Number Four Spanner, and mine went over the side when we hit that <a href=\"/wiki/Holli_Dylford\" title=\"Holli Dylford\">goddamn mermaid</a>. Better see about getting another Number Four from up in the Wonders bloody soon, 'cause if that tank blows when we're submerged, it'll be bye-bye Redhammer.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714215952\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.050 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.051 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1663/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 29392/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7439/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 936276/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   40.130      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   40.130      1 -total\n 57.39%   23.0